cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Proactive Feasibility Scheduler: An Evaluation Study of
  ML-Based GPU Job Scheduling
message: >-
  If you use this software, its results, or its methodology in
  your work, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rakshit
    family-names: Rameshbabu
